      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "能用列举法表示的集合一般是有限集，但对于一些有规律的无限集，在不会引起歧义的前提下，也可用列举法表示. 例如，全体正偶数组成的集合可以表示为 {2,4,6,⋯,2n,⋯}.",
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p11_b18",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        375.0,
        745.0,
        625.0,
        765.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "集合还有另外一种表示方法.",
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p11_b19",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        335.0,
        770.0,
        905.0,
        825.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "在大括号内先写出这个集合中元素的一个记号，再画一条竖线，并在竖线的右边写上集合中所有元素具有的共同特征，即",
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p11_b20",
      "kind": "equation",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "equation",
      "bbox": [
        515.0,
        835.0,
        720.0,
        855.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "A={x|x 满足性质 p}.",
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": "A = \\{x \\mid x \\text{ 满足性质 } p\\}.",
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": [
          {
            "kind": "math",
            "raw": "A={x|x ",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "满足性质",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": " p}.",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p11_b21",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        335.0,
        860.0,
        905.0,
        925.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "这种表示集合的方法叫做描述法. 例如，方程 x²-3x+2=0 的所有解组成的集合可以表示为 {x|x²-3x+2=0}. 又如，函数 y=x 图像上的所有点组成的集合可以表示为 {(x,y)|y=x}.",
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "这种表示集合的方法叫做描述法",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": ". ",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "例如，方程",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": " x²-3x+2=0 ",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "的所有解组成的集合可以表示为",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": " {x|x²-3x+2=0}. ",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "又如，函数",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "math",
            "raw": " y=x ",
            "latex": "y = x",
            "valid": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "图像上的所有点组成的集合可以表示为",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "math",
            "raw": " {(x,y)|y=x}.",
            "latex": "\\{ ( x , y ) | y = x \\} .",
            "valid": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p11_b22",
